<title>USA: Lowe's sees Q2 EPS below expectations.</title>
<headline>Lowe's sees Q2 EPS below expectations.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH WILKESBORO, N.C. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lowe's Cos Inc said Thursday it expects second quarter earnings per share of $0.71 to $0.75, which is below analysts' estimates.</p>
<p>Analysts estimate second quarter earnings at $0.79 a share, according to First Call.</p>
<p>In a press release, Lowe's also said estimates for full-year earnings in the range of $1.97 to $2.03 per share are &quot;reasonable.&quot;</p>
</text>
